  "description": "The criminal organization disrupting the city's order. Do Hyun-Woo, the hound deployed to uncover the secrets of the Black Cloud Society. Infiltrating was fine, but for some reason, a figure named Team Leader Ha began obstructing Hyun-Woo's every move. \n\n *“Well, I'm just a beta, you know?!”\n\n“This is weird. But why does this smell so damn tempting?”*\n\nTeam Leader Ha, who invades even his personal space, causes complications in the undercover operation...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
